Torrentino
Torrentino is a sleek, web-based torrent management UI built with Next.js and TailwindCSS. It connects to a running qBittorrent instance via its Web API, allowing you to manage torrents directly from a modern, responsive interface.

Features
Add torrents via magnet links
View and manage active torrents (status, progress, speeds)
Modern UI powered by TailwindCSS
Configurable API layer with environment variables
Frontend + API integration for seamless torrent control
Tech Stack
Frontend: Next.js, React, Tailwind CSS

Backend: Check torrent server api (https://github.com/shounakdev/torrent-server)

